WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.920
A portfolio is how clients and employers decide to hire you.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.605
Choose your best five to eight pieces, of different kinds.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:13.856
For each piece, explain the problem, your solution and the result.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:17.606
Real projects for local businesses are the most convincing.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.355
Share it online, and keep a small PDF to send on WhatsApp.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:34.206
Before you move on, check: Choose your best 5 to 8 pieces. Write the problem and solution for each. Make a small PDF version. Submit your poster project.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.254
Well done. You have finished the course. Now design a poster for a real event.
